    "html_url": "https://github.com/romaine-life/kill-me/commit/2b761584ff017c487b705bfbcfcd455f6b2d4395",
    "message": "feat: add Bayesian curl variation and make variation chips read as controls\n\nBayesian curl (13 lbs x 12 x 3) joins Cable Bicep Curl as a fourth variation\nalongside Standard / Rope Hammer / Single Arm. Already upserted into Cosmos, so\nthis keeps seed-data.js in sync for a fresh database init.\n\nThe variation chips in the detailed log were styled as dim gray pills that read\nas metadata tags rather than selectable options — the Concentration variation\nhad been sitting on Dumbbell Bicep Curl unnoticed. They now carry a VARIATION\nlabel, full-contrast text on a visible border, a larger tap target, and\naria-pressed for the selected one.",
